# Web Interface Router

Canon: `AGENTS.md`, then `documents/ai/manuals/frontend.md`.

Use for UI/template/static/frontend edits.

Rules:

- Keep business policy out of UI.
- Preserve accessibility basics: labels, focus visibility, keyboard path, aria labels for icon buttons.
- Avoid `transition: all`, unlabelled inputs, layout shift, and images without dimensions.
- Use Tailwind utilities in templates unless reuse justifies component CSS.
- Verify visible UI changes with browser/screenshot when practical.

References: `documents/ai/manuals/frontend.md`, `.cursor/rules/django-apps.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/architecture.mdc`.
